pics.\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Figure skating [edit]\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Shen Xue and Zhao Hongbo are considered by many critics of the sport to be one of the best pair skating teams of all time.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"[citation needed] Since the 1990s, China has been one of the top nations in the pairs events of figure skating.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Shen and Zhao have won multiple world championships and Olympic medals, solidifying their status as legends in the sport.\"}]}"
